WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.000
[calm electronic music]

2
00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:02.600
[keys typing]

3
00:00:03.333 --> 00:00:06.333
Every coding agent has a usage limit.

4
00:00:08.333 --> 00:00:10.400
And it always hits at the worst moment.

5
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:13.500
Thousands of developers are asking for auto-resume.

6
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.900
Mid-task, your agent stops. The limit resets at three a.m., and nobody's there to say continue.

7
00:00:21.333 --> 00:00:24.333
[clock ticking]

8
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.567
[music rises]

9
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:26.600
Meet Agent Rewake.

10
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:31.786
It schedules your resume prompt automatically, for the moment the limit resets.

11
00:00:27.467 --> 00:00:28.967
[chime]

12
00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:33.200
[whoosh]

13
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:35.000
[clock ticking]

14
00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:36.167
[chime]

15
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.233
At three oh one, it sends your message. Same session, same context, same thread.

16
00:00:40.333 --> 00:00:42.900
Then the next message, and the next.

17
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:45.567
Fully configurable, even the resume prompt.

18
00:00:45.667 --> 00:00:50.733
Send later. Repeat on a schedule. Even cron, read back in plain words.

19
00:00:50.833 --> 00:00:53.119
Every thread, on one page.

20
00:00:53.667 --> 00:00:56.900
Rewake works with the coding agents you already use.

21
00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.643
One plugin for all of them.

22
00:01:00.333 --> 00:01:02.267
[keys typing]

23
00:01:00.333 --> 00:01:02.976
One command sets it all up.

24
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:02.600
[keys typing]

25
00:01:02.333 --> 00:01:03.833
[chime]

26
00:01:04.167 --> 00:01:06.500
No more babysitting for your AI agents.

27
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:11.800
[music resolves and fades out]

28
00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:10.671
Agent Rewake. Free and open source, for your coding agents.
